engine with strict per-operation deadlines, generation rechecks, and
AX-side state memory for reconciliation, while attach, terminate, and
restore mirror the landed backend, fencing, and axpane gates. Quiesce
cuts operator input by locking then detaching every attached client
and refusing new input-authorized attaches at the entry (read-only
observation stays); the boundary waits blocking for the wrapper
signal with the proof kind bound into its evidence; probes prove
